<title>UK: EIB sets 125 million mark structured five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 125 million mark structured five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Goldman Sachs International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    125 MLN DEM   BASE	*6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    28.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *+ 23 BP   PAY DATE    28.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  99.90     FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC   10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	*INITIAL COUPON, SUBSEQUENT COUPONS ARE THE LESSER</p>
<p>		 OF 6-MONTH LIBOR PLUS 23 BP OR THE PREVIOUS COUPON</p>
<p>		 PLUS 33 BP</p>
<p>		 ISSUED OFF THE MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
